DATA SOURCES

The biomarker data in shared/data/ is curated from publicly available clinical
references including:

- Tietz Textbook of Laboratory Medicine (Rifai, 2022/2023)
- Mosby's Diagnostic & Laboratory Test Reference (Pagana, 2019)
- StatPearls (NCBI Bookshelf)
- Various peer-reviewed publications cited within ranges.json

Reference range citations are preserved in the data files (source_label,
article_name, article_year fields).

